#: includes/courier-core.php:0
msgid "The Store ID you saved is not in this list. Please correct it."
msgstr "আপনার সেভ করা Store ID এই তালিকায় নেই। সেটা ঠিক করুন।"

#: includes/courier-core.php:0
msgid ""
"BD Courier did not answer. The record of other shops could not be loaded; "
